rial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          风味：花香、杏桃、柚子、龙眼\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Floral, Apricot, Pomelo, Longan\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QrCcyiaBsZoee2pwRwkDFusM954NuDHrWRvRcGStMVicKLp2ibPYjvQqXnDicRicYV456F8uyeurftK9g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SANvK175VaJ7FbBNJWgLoPCTLH62GskxuO0rAsZQUV7tR7BdyJ2EaOvj99todDAUEFvy4RghMyLA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;text-align: center;display: initial;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 8px;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            关于\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n          希望庄园（Café Granja La Esperanza）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px 0px 24px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n          布兰卡· 里格加·科瑞（Blanca ligia correa）和胡安·安东尼奥·海瑞拉（juan antonio herrera）结婚，养育了14个孩子。这对夫妇后来被分配到波斯特西农场（postosi farm）工作，在此定居下来。1945年，除了种植铁皮卡（Typica）以外，胡安·安东尼奥决定引入三种不同的咖啡品种，开始种植黄波旁（Yellow Bourbon）、红波旁（Red Bourbon）和卡杜拉（Caturra）等三个品种的咖啡。于是，1945年，希望庄园就此诞生。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px 0px 24px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SSBut4Zxibo1Vo0snHWqETpRDVDPDMCBJTKtjD2ZBEaljMHz6QAkXyYeFwnyR6icdiaEl6fTts4ZOhg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px 0px 24px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n</span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          希望庄园旗下有5个农场，分别\n         </span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          是\n         </span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px 0px 24px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n            Hawaii ， 位于\n            <span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n             Cundinamarca-\n             <span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n              Sasaima\n             </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px 0px 24px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n            Potosi，位于Cauca-\n            <span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n             Caicedonia\n            </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px 0px 24px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n             La Esperanza\n            </span>\n            ， 位于Cauca-\n            <span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n             Trujillo\n            </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px 0px 24px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n             Las Margaritas，位于\n             <span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n              Cauca-\n             </span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n              Caicedonia\n             </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px 0px 24px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n              Cerro Azul，\n              <span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n               位于Cauca-\n              </span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n               Trujillo\n              </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 8px;'>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
